    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup required\n\n**GetPosts** uses the core Discourse node against community.n8n.io — fill in the **Discourse community** credential (URL + read-only API key + username) before running.\n\n**Backfill**: run *Backfill (manual)* — up to 3000 latest posts, rolling 12-month window.\n**Daily**: 150 latest posts.\n\n**Dedupe**: `ingest_ledger` (source=forum, source_id=post_id) — re-running is safe.\n**Summaries**: after posts land, topics with NULL summary on their resource node are summarized (deepseek-v4-flash via OpenRouter) into `resource.summary` + `forum.metadata.summary`.\n\n**Drop-and-re-run**: `DELETE FROM forum; DELETE FROM resource WHERE path <@ 'forum' AND path != 'forum'; DELETE FROM ingest_ledger WHERE source='forum';` then run the backfill.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
